cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "prompt-correction-memory: self-correcting prompts for LLM document extraction"
abstract: >-
  Sample code for a correction memory that lets an LLM document-extraction
  pipeline learn from human corrections. Each correction is stored and fed back
  as few-shot guidance, and repeated corrections graduate into deterministic
  rules, so the same extraction mistake stops recurring without retraining or
  redeployment.
